      "writtenOn": "2025-11-03T10:03:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at both implementation, it seems that there is currently no support for incremental decoding. However, Ico format has support to it and in fact it has a comment with a TODO with respect to the gap in BMP format, so I think that this could be a valuable addition for rust implementation, while not required to match current status of the codecs.\n\nhttps://skia.googlesource.com/skia/+/refs/heads/main/src/codec/SkIcoCodec.cpp#361",
      "parentUuid": "5db63d47_3a18f034",
      "revId": "e33faf05ba40ab0f1496c3ce8c498d3e5c5672d4",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
